novael et caeléstium donórum semper par¬</l><l xml:id="m-86a5c2dd-175b-4b59-948e-cbfc38541e38" facs="#m-4f65b7ce-3c8a-4320-8838-90b7033c8893" label="lyrics-like">prolis amplíficas, tribue nobis: t ex l ticipatióne gaudére. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b65d6f50-33f5-4c09-b149-04d5cfd50572" facs="#m-e7f387cd-8659-48c8-aba5-404b9e0c40b4" label="lyrics-like">Gospel. Respóndens Jesus. p. 1391.</l><l xml:id="m-e3f55358-6c31-483d-8fea-96a5faed8805" facs="#m-f70316dc-2479-46f1-838f-13e80e0e9447" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-d5a0be19-dcd0-45c4-a751-aaed1d4e07b6" facs="#m-07027333-9807-46cc-aac2-f9649e43a09f" label="lyrics-like">(Cclésiam tuam, quaésumus Dó-] fessóris tui illuminàre voluísti glo¬</l><l xml:id="m-8a75c408-6324-4195-a177-db467d197e85" facs="#m-32e1ddc6-7124-4ffe-9729-b1d882b2e7f6" label="lyrics-like">C mine, grátia caeléstis ampli-[riósis méritis et exémplis. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-23cef4c6-2f29-4b4f-81b0-15974fbf7f61" facs="#m-f6cd2766-8f60-47e2-b765-7f6b7862d388" label="lyrics-like">ficet: quam beáti Francísci Con-]minum.</l><l xml:id="m-81ac4fd1-bf79-42c7-b602-09482c34c285" facs="#m-30eddd10-0ba9-4a6d-a3d8-49659c3e8ed6" label="text-like">St. Placid and his Companions, Martyrs. Simple.</l><l xml:id="m-ea0b5f00-f5d4-48b9-9fca-f12fc67a6958" facs="#m-37ecbc9c-bc55-4e1d-b594-d8e4cf6bceef" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-0601f4a9-fdca-4fba-8131-6caa5bdb7c66" facs="#m-fce47e53-9d38-4bbe-9806-13d058a33d84" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-906385a1-1e5f-44f9-aa9d-4021e79756bb" facs="#m-ec3a8fd0-9da5-4882-aeb9-b313d6346b21" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui nos concédis sanctórum da nobis in aetérna beatitúdine,</l><l xml:id="m-14134e19-4cc2-4183-be61-7545c1999fd4" facs="#m-e89e973f-dc7f-4c33-bc09-5e23d9841807" label="lyrics-like">A Mártyrum tuórum Plácidi et de eórum societáte gaudére. Per</l><l xml:id="m-23fbd80d-e818-4e26-bdb4-8275c55f5b95" facs="#m-ede804f7-e836-4312-a1fd-eccab7dab231" label="lyrics-like">Sociórum ejus natalitia cólere: tDóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-97a5ed96-33be-4259-abb9-85b9611cbbe8" facs="#m-2bcbf591-50e4-4224-8440-8c6f47b6b3ad" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Múnera tibi. Postcommunion. Praesta nobis. p. 1169.</l><l xml:id="m-3b374e99-1cf0-4ced-abc2-e32e716fb95b" facs="#m-de6c8970-a07e-4c61-b7b3-c31d804c299f" label="ambiguous">St. Bruno, Confessor.</l><l xml:id="m-0533ef7f-39ed-4fb8-a0d5-7f32ec27e38c" facs="#m-0b5ac009-d664-45a7-8895-5af1417bde20" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-30dfbcdc-0f4c-44d8-9482-aec067869e56" facs="#m-6175ea52-9a67-4520-b0d5-1cbfaae5e110" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-425780a3-d6f9-476f-a3f2-957fe1694023" facs="#m-2a69a60b-23cd-4895-aa27-7af0c44c9029" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Os jústi. p. 1200, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-e438a29a-5da1-4a88-9b43-b6e2d182d0b3" facs="#m-96290b7c-8abd-48ff-97f8-3cc53176771d" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-cbd6315b-7037-43b1-8f5a-1116d8c2b59a" facs="#m-8100c952-e7a0-49f1-b58c-4c93229ded65" label="lyrics-like">NAncti Brunónis Confessóris tui,] offéndimus, * ejus méritis et préci¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ab0d5c0-7d1f-42c8-a55d-96ebb4dbcf8c" facs="#m-486f6d5a-c329-4f67-a0af-11485f05d759" label="lyrics-like">quaésumus Dómine, interces</l><l xml:id="m-1ae52ded-518a-469c-b1fa-38e710d6e4c2" facs="#m-cf674ed9-8800-43ab-9406-a837ee0c0830" label="lyrics-like">bus nostrórum delictórum véniam</l><l xml:id="m-06621725-1121-4852-838b-fe410f880699" facs="#m-a9ed2b0c-73b1-4b0d-b0be-87f4fa34fc35" label="lyrics-like">siónibus adjuvémur : t ut qui maje-consequámur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e9d494cc-3799-4ace-80f3-b584c11b6040" facs="#m-0b136edf-8cfc-4118-9f30-3b1114ae34ce" label="lyrics-like">státem tuam gráviter delinquéndo!</l><l xml:id="m-fcb2fc37-15be-41b3-bcea-611aeb093a83" facs="#m-7ca8afe0-ff95-4783-8df5-f8820494b20f" label="lyrics-like">Postcommunion. Quaésumus. p. 1206.</l><l xml:id="m-712224b4-2f22-4e93-8bbd-0433067edfe8" facs="#m-0486bdc2-d4e1-4097-8428-1f89fb7de95e" label="text-like">7. THE SOLEMNITY OF THE MOST HOLY ROSARY.</l><l xml:id="m-4e69b697-2931-40be-8728-65ba7bc23232" facs="#m-c6c53c6c-bd3a-44b5-98d7-cdd9f994d02f" label="text-like">Double of the Second Class.</l><l xml:id="m-904a48f3-d555-4a1c-8b5e-325805c6c1e6" facs="#m-0ba96f6e-2efa-4dad-8e30-7108e7c69e46" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-8130e497-3629-46dd-8d0a-850b427f49f6" facs="#m-3eb9ee2f-ebb2-44a5-b540-38a27c812b4c" label="text-like">All as at second Vespers, p. 1679, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-78250b0b-12b0-4f53-87b2-2a20731112c3" facs="#m-e23d766c-5804-4a9f-8fa3-690683512421" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-b3e9e204-c8f3-4bff-87ff-5de5acc34121" facs="#m-c593372e-ca4b-467a-86b3-503c203d5f2f" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-ad4a0d23-789f-46a8-a8a7-b45a9d5ea969" facs="#m-e1e3b41e-a279-48e3-8702-cf528539fe80" label="lyrics-like">Aeléstis áulae Núnti-us, Arcána pándens Númi¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
